  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @brief Processing function for the Q31 FIR decimator.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @param[in] *S points to an instance of the Q31 FIR decimator structure.
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrc points to the block of input data.
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @param[out] *pDst points to the block of output data
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @param[in] blockSize number of input samples to process per call.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * @return none
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  *
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * \par
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * The function is implemented using an internal 64-bit accumulator.
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * The accumulator has a 2.62 format and maintains full precision of the intermediate multiplicatio
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * Thus, if the accumulator result overflows it wraps around rather than clip.
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * In order to avoid overflows completely the input signal must be scaled down by log2(numTaps) bit
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * After all multiply-accumulates are performed, the 2.62 accumulator is truncated to 1.32 format a
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  *
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * \par
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  * Refer to the function <code>arm_fir_decimate_fast_q31()</code> for a faster but less precise imp
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_decimate_q31.c ****  */
